Origin: EmberBSD, AI-assisted refresh of the pinned NetBSD pkgsrc Libtool recipe.
Preserves pkgsrc patch provenance; source macro changes generate configure/ltmain.
Not submitted upstream. See ../libtool.md for regeneration and validation.
The recipe keeps the upstream .tar.gz archive. An xz archive makes the
native libtool-base build depend on archivers/xz, which uses Libtool.

